{"id":181883355,"slug":"how-to-ruin-your-relationships","title":"How To Ruin Your Relationships","subtitle":"Conversations with AI Chatbots Are Giving Us Bad Advice for Our Relationships","post_date":"2025-12-17T13:24:29.750Z","audience":"everyone","type":"podcast","canonical_url":"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/how-to-ruin-your-relationships","wordcount":271,"source":"api","fetched_at":"2026-09-13T21:45:29.552Z","body_sha256":"57b5ed8d58759469421f2bd52d0461acbf3103da71b24d3c60c7c0ff31dfceba","text_words":279,"complete":true,"body_html":"<p>One of the things I like about being on the Internet is that I get to meet the actual humans!  There are people I've had real relationships with over many years, and some of them I've just never gotten to see in person yet.   Making content on the Internet helps connect you to other people making content on the Internet, and if you're good at making friends, sometimes you can make a new friend.   One such friend is featured in this podcast, and it's Annalisa Hanson—she is a <a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/link/v2?aid=1988&amp;lang=en&amp;scene=bio_url&amp;target=Geminicounselingandconsulting.com\">therapist</a>, who made some <a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@my_goth_therapist\">great content on TikTok</a>, and then we hopped on the phone because we were such mutual fans, and then she joined me here on the podcast.   Another guest on this episode is Dr. Mason Hargrave— we met on Clubhouse—and then he invited me to record a podcast in what was his apartment at the time.  It's a classic:</p><div id=\"youtube2-wHWOjPVAMgg\" class=\"youtube-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;videoId&quot;:&quot;wHWOjPVAMgg&quot;,&quot;startTime&quot;:null,&quot;endTime&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"Youtube2ToDOM\"><div class=\"youtube-inner\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/wHWOjPVAMgg?rel=0&amp;autoplay=0&amp;showinfo=0&amp;enablejsapi=0\" frameborder=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" gesture=\"media\" allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen\" allowautoplay=\"true\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" width=\"728\" height=\"409\"></iframe></div></div><p>Today’s conversation grew out of a phone call with Annalisa, followed by subsequent calls with <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/brandonin/\">Brandon In</a>, Mason, <a href=\"https://medicine.yale.edu/profile/ahmed-tahseen/\">Ahmed Tahseen</a>, and a concluding conversation with my daughter Quinn.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!uHwX!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9ca658ff-2b95-400d-b8df-c9aad08a2f81_4032x3024.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!uHwX!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9ca658ff-2b95-400d-b8df-c9aad08a2f81_4032x3024.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!uHwX!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9ca658ff-2b95-400d-b8df-c9aad08a2f81_4032x3024.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!uHwX!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9ca658ff-2b95-400d-b8df-c9aad08a2f81_4032x3024.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!uHwX!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9ca658ff-2b95-400d-b8df-c9aad08a2f81_4032x3024.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!uHwX!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9ca658ff-2b95-400d-b8